flowchart LR
    Client[Codex Projects connection] --> Helper[Run configured local header helper]
    Helper --> Store[Read named Windows Generic credential]
    Store --> Header[Authorization JSON through private MCP helper pipe]
    Header --> Official[Official GitHub Projects MCP endpoint]
    Official --> Tools[Projects read / write tools]
    Missing[Missing or invalid credential] --> Fail[Nonzero exit; no header or secret diagnostic]
    Store --> Missing
